WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary digest v1.0 — planetary-digest (ha) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:15.209
<v Narrator>Barka da zuwa ga OpenIE Research Radio Planetary Digest, mai gabatar da 29 na bincike-bincike masu sauki a kan tsarin sarrafa wutar lantarki wanda za'a iya tabbatarwa.

2
00:00:15.289 --> 00:00:36.374
<v Narrator>A cikinmu 4-mataki lookup-first cascade, sauri constant-lokaci hash teburin, trigram bincike indiya, da daidai integer solvers kula da tambayoyi na yau da kullum a cikin gida, waking manyan neural models kawai kamar wani karshe gudu.

3
00:00:36.454 --> 00:01:04.351
<v Narrator>A cikin layi 5-volt board shunts da 0.09 zuwa 0.11 bisa dari idle drift, unpacking 0.1517 bits-per-ma'aunin matrici baya ga 32-bit floats kashe 81.86 sau fiye da board energy than 8-bit integers, yayin da packed integer logic ya fadi zuwa 187.49 microjoules gross da kuma yanke full cascade energy 26.58 sau.

4
00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:23.790
<v Narrator>Duk wani bincike yana da hashe na cryptographic, determinism na 6-fabbrication cross-architecture, 24-kilobit Opus low-bandwidth feeds, fassara mai tsawo ta sauti, da Creative Commons Zero plain-language summaries.
